@startuml playerStateDiagram
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor LightGray
  BorderColor Black
  FontName "Arial"
}
[*] --> Idle

Idle --> Running : Press move key
Running --> Idle : Stop moving
Running --> Jumping : Press jump key
Idle --> Jumping : Press jump key

Jumping --> Falling : Gravity
Falling --> Idle : Touch ground
Falling --> Running : Touch ground + move key

Running --> Collecting : Overlaps with key
Collecting --> Running : Resume

Running --> AtExit : Overlaps with exit
AtExit --> [*] : Level complete
@enduml
